# Firebase Admin SDK service account keys — NEVER commit.
# These grant full server-side access to the Firebase project. They live only
# in Supabase edge function secrets (FCM_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON).
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-service-account*.json
serviceAccountKey.json

# Knowledge base — private content. NEVER commit.
# This repository is PUBLIC and docs/ is the published GitHub Pages root, so
# security-sensitive knowledge (threat model, RLS policy inventory, privileged
# function audit, incident history, debt register) cannot live here. It is
# backed by a separate PRIVATE repository cloned into this path — not stored
# only on one machine, which would be an unrecoverable single point of failure.
# The public kb/ holds stubs that name these documents without their content.
# See kb/ai-org/knowledge-base-spec.md §4.
kb/private/
